  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "きょうれつな　かぜで　あいてを\nつつみこんで　こうげきする。\nあいてを　こんらん　させることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "강렬한 바람으로 상대를\n둘러싸서 공격한다.\n상대를 혼란시킬 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用強烈的風席捲\n對手進行攻擊。\n有時會使對手混亂。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur déclenche une tempête de vents violents\nqui s’abat sur l’ennemi. Peut aussi le rendre confus.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender greift das Ziel an, indem er es mit heftigen\nWindböen umgibt. Ziel wird eventuell verwirrt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Golpea al objetivo con un fuerte torbellino que\nenvuelve al rival y puede confundirlo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa attacca il bersaglio avvolgendolo con\nun vento fortissimo. Può anche confonderlo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks by wrapping its opponent in a\nfierce wind that flies up into the sky. This may also\nconfuse the target.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "強烈な　風で　相手を\n包みこんで　攻撃する。\n相手を　混乱させることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用强烈的风\n席卷对手进行攻击。\n有时会使对手混乱。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Golpea al objetivo con un fuerte torbellino que\nenvuelve al rival y puede confundirlo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
